  m_text: 'Cecilia stumbles on a room with a hole on the wall in the shape of a fist.
    A faint voice comes back to her "Hey Cece, check this out!" Followed by a loud
    crash. Cecilia instinctively places a hand on her chest, but there is no heartbeat.


    The
    room seems safe enough to conduct quick repairs.'
